// Belmont County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor's search,
// St. Mary's Central School and the Belmont and Brookside village sites) were
// checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's site is belmontcountyauditor.org ("Belmont County Real
//     Estate Search", ISSG), not Data Dynamics. belmontcountyauditors.org (with
//     an s) is a third-party site the Auditor warns about.
//   * Barkcamp State Park now links ODNR, not the tourism site.
//   * belmontcountyconnections.com is OhioMeansJobs Belmont County.
//   * The county's own Links page is badly out of date: Bellaire, the Board of
//     Elections, the Recorder, solid waste and the Port Authority have all moved;
//     the Prosecutor, EMA and Animal Shelter links are dead.
//   * Bridgeport schools moved to bridgeportschools.net; the career center is
//     Belmont-Harrison Career Center (bhccenters.com).
//   * Dysart Woods passed from Ohio University to Captina Conservancy in 2022.
//
// CLOSED
//
//   East Ohio Regional Hospital (Martins Ferry) closed again in March 2025 and
//   remains vacant; Belmont Community Hospital (Bellaire) closed in 2019;
//   Crossroads Counseling closed in 2024; St. John Central Academy (Bellaire)
//   closed in 2025; the Bellaire chamber is defunct; the Belmont County Animal
//   Rescue League shut down. Trinity Health St. Clairsville opened in 2025; WVU
//   Medicine's St. Clairsville hospital is under construction.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Belmont (MA, CA, NC, NH; Belmont University TN), Bellaire (TX, MI —
//   bellairechamber.org is Michigan), Bridgeport (CT, WV), Shadyside (PA),
//   villageofyorkville.com (Wisconsin). Wheeling, WV bodies are across the river;
//   United Way of the Upper Ohio Valley and Belomar are Wheeling-based but serve
//   Belmont County and are flagged.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Two cities (St. Clairsville, Martins Ferry), fourteen villages, sixteen
//     townships. Fairview is partly in Guernsey, Wilson in Monroe and Yorkville
//     in Jefferson. Only Richland Township has its own site.
//   * Solid waste is the Jefferson-Belmont authority (JB Green Team). Building
//     permits go to the Mid-East Ohio Building Department in Zanesville.
//   * Transit is EORTA, run jointly with OVRTA from Wheeling.
//   * The mental-health board, Tri-County Help Center and several providers
//     serve Belmont, Harrison and Monroe together.
//   * Piedmont Lake straddles Belmont and Harrison; its marina is in Freeport.
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: the Prosecutor's own domain (dead),
// EMA and Animal Shelter (dead links), the Recorder's Kofile search and court
// eServices (blocked), Barnesville Hutton Memorial Library (no working site),
// Speiro Academy and Habitat (no sites), the Common Pleas General Division
// (no separate site), and fifteen townships and six villages with no site.

